<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Entitlements for a build signed with a FREE personal Apple team (apaki/mobile, 2026-10-10).
  A personal team cannot sign Associated Domains, so this file is App.entitlements without it:
  the app installs and runs on the owner's own iPhone, but passkeys (the Apaki account) and
  Universal Links for pairing are off. Scanning the PC's QR in the app and the apaki:// link still pair.
  Selected by scripts/ios-device.sh --personal (APAKI_ENTITLEMENTS in Signing.xcconfig).
  A paid team and TestFlight use App.entitlements.
-->
